Package: dendromatic
Title: Processing, Cleaning and Normalization of Dendrometer Time Series
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("João Gabriel", "Leal Martins",
           email = "joaogabriellealmartins@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Tools for point-dendrometer data pipelines: ingest raw logger
    tables of any shape into the 'treenetproc' L0 format, process to L1/L2,
    correct sensor relocations and jumps with growth-aware level shifting,
    erase dormancy periods and align growing seasons, merge consecutive
    series from the same tree, extract predawn and midday tree water
    deficit extrema, and match leaf water potential campaigns to stem
    features. The computational core behind the 'DendroMatic' Shiny
    applications, usable standalone in scripted workflows.
